  "actual_wording_delta": "--- \n+++ \n@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@\n     sup_(0<=t<=T) global quantum/marked-output trace error\n       <=C_T[epsilon n\u00b3+epsilon\u00b2n\u2076+n\u2076/(S(S+1))].\n \n-Here the comparison is to the true canonical W0 rotor target, including every later sector, its same-metric electric term K D, the landed local magnetic pair Hamiltonian, and the unchanged original marked formation operators. Constants depend on fixed delta,kappa,K,T, but not on n,S or register size. A sufficient finite-parameter hypothesis is epsilon n\u00b2<=c0, with universal positive c0 derived in the proof.\n+Here the comparison is to the true canonical W0 rotor target, including every later sector, its common diagonal electric term K D, the landed local magnetic pair Hamiltonian, and the unchanged original marked formation operators. Constants depend on fixed delta,kappa,K,T, but not on n,S or register size. A sufficient finite-parameter hypothesis is epsilon n\u00b2<=c0, with universal positive c0 derived in the proof.\n \n Consequently n=o(S^(1/3)) is a genuine explicit joint window. For example, safe even L(S)=2 floor(S^(1/12)/2) gives n=O(S^(1/4)) and error O_T(S^-1/4). This is not a qualitative diagonal subsequence selected after fixed-graph convergence.\n \n@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@\n \n Family tuple: original full quantum/GKSL carrier and compensated law; bare Omega; exact P/Q spectral rotation and Sylvester loss correction; global trace and complete original finite-volume history output; fixed physical T; explicit joint n,S scaling. This differs from the earlier uniform-local dark-response, source-tail, positive-filter and energy routes, without declaring those questions solved.\n \n-The supplied quantum carrier, Gauss constraint, Hamiltonian, instrument, time and preparation remain premises. No native M2/quantum interpretation, physical energy/clock supplier, axiom or primitive is adopted. Arbitrary-volume uniform local approximation, microscopic unbounded-energy convergence, broader scaling paths and normalized rare-history comparison remain open. A finite global density window does not establish those stronger consumers.\n+The supplied quantum carrier, Gauss constraint, Hamiltonian, instrument, time and preparation remain premises. No native M2/quantum interpretation, physical energy/clock supplier, axiom or primitive is adopted. Arbitrary-volume uniform local approximation, microscopic unbounded-energy convergence, broader scaling paths and normalized rare-history comparison remain open. This restricted growing-volume window does not establish those stronger consumers.\n \n ## Checks and remaining check request\n \n",
